{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2ad","chatId":"db1663485b1945988cb64b4e664c0e28","sessionId":null,"userId":68536,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1089,"promptTokens":1480,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003170701554045121,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2ac","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722551,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2ac","chatId":"db1663485b1945988cb64b4e664c0e28","sessionId":null,"userId":68536,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n菲比的商业想法遭到了许多投资者的拒绝。就在她快要崩溃和放弃的时候，她收到了一封电子邮件，里面是一位以投资有雄心的初创企业而闻名的风险投资家发来的邀请。菲比在回复之前把邮件重读了几遍。“我就知道，”她用沙哑、颤抖的声音说。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，菲比最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 紧张\nC) 反对\nD) 绝望\nE) 不关心\nF) 悲观\n\n## 问题 2\n菲比为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她在快要放弃的时候收到了一份邀请\nB) 她最终放弃了她的商业想法\nC) 她事先知道结果却毫不在意\nD) 她一直希望能遇到一位风险投资人","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003170701554045121,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8bad6006945d280a2ad","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369722549,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"35f2be86b001449cb8acdd6b014c0fc3"}